* Vacuum Tube Models for DEWB / SPICE / Xyce
* Norman Koren Improved Vacuum Tube Models (Glass Audio 1996)

.SUBCKT 12AX7 1 2 3 ; Plate, Grid, Cathode
+ PARAMS: MU=100 EX=1.4 KG1=1060 KP=600 KVB=300 RGI=2000
+ CCG=1.6P CGP=1.7P CCP=0.46P
E1 7 0 VALUE={V(1,3)/KP*LOG(1+EXP(KP*(1/MU+V(2,3)/SQRT(KVB+V(1,3)*V(1,3)))))}
RE1 7 0 1G
G1 1 3 VALUE={(PWR(V(7),EX)+PWRS(V(7),EX))/KG1}
RCP 1 3 1G
C1 2 3 {CCG}
C2 2 1 {CGP}
C3 1 3 {CCP}
D3 5 3 DX
R1 2 5 {RGI}
.MODEL DX D(IS=1N RS=1 CJO=1PF TT=1N)
.ENDS

.SUBCKT 12AU7 1 2 3 ; Plate, Grid, Cathode
+ PARAMS: MU=20 EX=1.3 KG1=1250 KP=220 KVB=240 RGI=2000
+ CCG=1.6P CGP=1.5P CCP=0.4P
E1 7 0 VALUE={V(1,3)/KP*LOG(1+EXP(KP*(1/MU+V(2,3)/SQRT(KVB+V(1,3)*V(1,3)))))}
RE1 7 0 1G
G1 1 3 VALUE={(PWR(V(7),EX)+PWRS(V(7),EX))/KG1}
RCP 1 3 1G
C1 2 3 {CCG}
C2 2 1 {CGP}
C3 1 3 {CCP}
D3 5 3 DX
R1 2 5 {RGI}
.MODEL DX D(IS=1N RS=1 CJO=1PF TT=1N)
.ENDS
